// Pillar 5, M3 the drill (Day 3, Wednesday 14:50, the Works bay): a one-step training moment. Head writer, seat W.
title: Fire drill
from: Chief Ines Calder
gist: Calder briefed you for the Wednesday drill: fire this week. Extinguisher, hatch, wait for the all-clear.
== lines
calder: Drill at three. Fire, this week.   [gesture]
calder > you: Extinguisher off its bracket by the door. Stand by the hatch. Wait for me.
calder: It rotates. Fire, pressure, power. Your Calendar says which.
calder: I time the team. Not you. The team.
calder: Back to it. Ten minutes.
